---
---

<section class="second-opinion-section">
  <div class="container banner-inner">
    <div class="banner-text">
      <span class="banner-badge">Second Opinion Available</span>
      <h2 class="banner-title font-heading">Turned down somewhere else?</h2>
      <p class="banner-subtitle">
        A "no" from one franchise dealer isn't a "no" from every Canadian lender. Text Kirk what happened. He'll tell you honestly why you were rejected, and what options will actually get approved.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="banner-actions">
      <a href="sms:+17788882093?body=Hi%20Kirk%2C%20I%20applied%20at%20another%20dealership%20and%20got%20turned%20down.%20Can%20you%20help%20me%20look%20at%20options%3F" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>Text Kirk What Happened</span>
      </a>
      <span class="banner-subnote">Or call (778) 888-2093 · Asking doesn't touch your credit</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .second-opinion-section {
    background-color: var(--amber);
    color: var(--dark-base);
    padding: 60px 0;
  }

  .banner-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .banner-text {
    flex: 1 1 540px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .banner-badge {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: rgba(20, 24, 29, 0.8);
  }

  .banner-title {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--dark-base);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .banner-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #242B35;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .banner-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .banner-subnote {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(20, 24, 29, 0.75);
  }
</style>
